VidTalk: clean-slate plan

We'll build it in small stages, and I will not jump ahead or dump the whole application on you.

Target architecture
                    VIDTALK
                       │
          ┌────────────┴────────────┐
          │                         │
   Android App                 FastAPI Backend
   Kotlin                      Python
   Jetpack Compose             │
   MVVM                        │
   Retrofit                    │
   Media3                      │
   CameraX                     │
          │                     │
          └──────────┬──────────┘
                     │
                  REST API
                     │
              ┌──────┴──────┐
              │             │
         PostgreSQL      Cloudinary
         Database        Video Storage
Phase 1: Create the project

We'll create a completely new directory:

VidTalk/
├── backend/
├── android/
└── README.md

No old Flask code.
No old Expo code.
No migration headaches.

